      <h1>Top 10 Varsity Jacket Manufacturers in China: An Honest Factory-Side Guide for B2B Buyers</h1>
      <p class="ar-meta">
        <span>By <strong rel="author">YAUUM Sourcing Team</strong></span>
        <span>Published <time datetime="2026-10-15">October 15, 2026</time></span>
      <span class="ar-views" data-views-for="/top-10-varsity-jacket-manufacturers-china/" data-views-hit></span>
      </p>
      <p class="ar-lede">Most "top 10 varsity jacket manufacturers in China" lists are written by people who have never stood next to a chenille machine. They recycle the same company names, paste a logo, and call it research. If you are deciding where to place a 3,000-piece order, that list sells you confidence you have not earned</p>
